<li id="bib.bib17" class="ltx_bibitem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem"><span id="bib.bib17.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">[17]</span></span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span id="bib.bib17.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
Thomas Hadjistavropoulos, Keela Herr, Kenneth M. Prkachin, Kenneth D. Craig, Stephen J. Gibson, Andreas Lukas, and Jennifer H. Smith.
</span>
</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span id="bib.bib17.8" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Pain assessment in elderly adults with dementia.
</span>
</span>
